---
# Test: syntax-class with matching argument
# A syntax class is defined and used in a macro; passing a matching argument succeeds.

[syntax-class identifier-only
  pattern: [let _ : VarRef]
  message: "bare identifier"]

[macro greet [let name@identifier-only]
  [str "Hello, " [unquote name]]]

[greet world]

=== out

"Hello, world"
